Z||000000||kornholio||11-09-1999||09:08 PM||||I have small tears on both sides of my front fascia where the side marker lights are.  Can I fix them by putting some adhesive over the tears, sand it then paint over it?  Or am I dreaming of a whole new (used) fascia?||||reg||1
Z||000001||lowCG||11-10-1999||01:43 AM||||An aluminum plate,behind,riveted to the fascia,with several rivets,is probably your only solution,besides a new part.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Carrolles||11-10-1999||08:39 AM||||The service manual shows a tpical repair technique using fiberglass mat on the back side for strength and body filler to mend the cosmetics.<P>I believe there is also a repair kit on the market for flexible bumper cover material.||||reg||1
